<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: VITKOVICE POSTS H1 CZK 386 MLN GROSS LOSS.</title>
<headline>VITKOVICE POSTS H1 CZK 386 MLN GROSS LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary unaudited results for six month period ending June 30, 1996, according to figures filed with the Czech Central Securities Registry (SCP) (in million crowns):</p>
<p>  gross result	    386.062 loss     vs     149.538 profit</p>
<p>  operating profit	239.479 profit   vs     511.756</p>
<p>  total production   10,821.746	    vs  10,972.782</p>
</text>
